(text "D102 prevents output/injection current returning to the 5 V header.\nD103 bypasses LDO reverse stress when OUT remains charged.\nTVS clamp is 10.3 V at its specified pulse: U101 accepts up to 16 V.\nNo sustained 24/60 V miswire or IEC surge qualification is claimed." (at 20.32 109.22 0) (effects (font (size 1.05 1.05)) (justify left top)) (uuid "7dd45490-29a7-524e-858b-1969f939b3d0"))
(text "U101 SNS(2)接OUT；GND(3/5)与EP7接GND；保留输入/输出电容与散热铜要求。\nTLV767额定输出1A（TI datasheet）；250mA设计预留仍须按#4做叠板热校核，不能仅凭1A额定放行。" (at 213.36 109.22 0) (effects (font (size 1.05 1.05)) (justify left top)) (uuid "81988171-737f-533c-ae00-cdf08bf51293"))
