(text "RESET开漏；CT悬空的原20ms标称释放延迟保持。\nMR分压要求5V存在，即使ADC钳位给3.3V回供；SW2/C81及NRST监控保持。\nSWD已位于controller；CORE_RESET_OK经U105与PC7/RUN_ARM相与，才输出CTRL_READY。" (at 213.36 223.52 0) (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0)) (justify left top)) (uuid "046f474e-77de-500c-80c7-af945ac0f1cb"))
